- UG | ask the doctors what helps in the meantime, and try it patiently at home | v: benevolence, security | sphere: care.GU | chance: 58
- WB | start a fund in your parent's name to bring the operation to the local hospital | v: benevolence, power | lever: found | pushes: institution hospital | sphere: care.WB | chance: 48
- WR | volunteer as a driver for patients making the long trip to that hospital | v: benevolence, universalism | sphere: care.RW | chance: 78
works: The operation, when it comes, gives {parent} back much of what the illness took.
works: Whether or not {parent} has the operation, the family chooses together and is at peace with it.
fails: Two years pass on the list, and the surgeon moves abroad before {parent}'s turn comes.
fails: The journey and the fees drain the savings, and the result is smaller than the news promised.

