# world: sphere event neglect_scandal, selector place, share .05
== the care home on the evening news
tier: life event
stages: adult mature elder
age: 25-90
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
gap: 10-40
times: World event: neglect_scandal (sphere care). It answers the world's institution scandal in a house of care, often a C3 cover-up breaking (stage3-rules section 5 C3; the staff's own moment is 'the thing the bosses are hiding'); it reaches those with a parent in that house, about 1 in 20 residents of the place (share .05, estimate)
likelier: a parent in a care home, a home with thin funds and weak inspection
rarer: no parent in care, a home with strong inspectors
tone: trouble
life: family, community
horizon: months
roles: parent, sibling
who: parent
sphere: care
sphere_event: neglect_scandal
share: .05
earth: hidden camera footage from your parent's care home is on every screen; the owners resign, and the inspectors return
scene: The care home where {parent} lives is on the evening news: hidden camera footage of call bells left ringing, meals left out of reach, and records filled in for checks never made. The owners have resigned, and the inspectors are back.
scene W: There are laws for homes like this, and inspectors who were meant to enforce them. {N} wants every broken rule named.
scene U: {N} goes through {parent}'s own care records page by page, checking them against what {parent} remembers.
scene B: The owners will want this settled quietly and fast. {N} knows that gives the families some weight.
scene R: {N} watched the footage once, and drove straight there.
scene G: {N} thinks only of {parent}, and of getting them home where family can look after them.
